{"type":"message","id":"b344b6ae","parentId":"09ec9fc4","timestamp":"2026-04-13T19:04:19.805Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-04-13 19:04 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52aa75f13ca4ee8509b7b275a64\", \"sender_id\": \"ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1\", \"sender\": \"听风\", \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-04-11 06:01 UTC\" } ``` Sender (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"label\": \"听风 (ou_1\n- Assistant: 我需要更多信息来了解您的「梦境系统」项目。请问： 1. 这是您正在开发的软件项目、游戏、研究项目，还是其他类型的系统？ 2. 您是否有相关的代码仓库、文档或设计文档可以分享？ 3. 梦境系统的核心功能或目标是什么？ 目前我在工作区和记忆中没有找到关于「梦境系统」的信息，麻烦您补充一些背景资料，我才能为您提供准确的分析和建议。\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52aa0f2f00a0ee7cdc33760b606\", \"sender_id\": \"ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1\", \"sender\": \"听风\", \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-04-11 06:03 UTC\" } ``` Sender (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"label\": \"听风 (ou_1\n- Assistant: OpenClaw 的 **Dreaming（梦境）系统** 是一个实验性的**背景记忆整合系统**，属于 `memory-core` 插件的核心功能。它的设计理念是帮助 OpenClaw 自动将短期记忆信号转化为长期记忆，同时保持整个过程的可解释性和可审查性。 ## 🎯 核心功能 ### 1. **三个睡眠阶段的整合模型** Dreaming 系统模拟了人类睡眠的三个阶段： | 阶段 | 功能 | 持久化写入 | |------|------|------------| | **Light（浅睡）** | 摄入并整理近期记忆信号\n- User: A new session was started via /new or /reset. Run your Session Startup sequence - read the required files before responding to the user. Then greet the user in your configured persona, if one is provided. Be yourself - use your defined voice, mannerisms, and mood. Keep it t\n- User: [Sun 2026-04-12 05:50 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status. [Subagent Context] This subagent session is persistent and remains available for thread follow-up messages. [Subage\n- User: [Sun 2026-04-12 05:51 UTC] 请使用 Agent Browser 工具访问 https://yasfi7qlk3r4.space.minimaxi.com/，获取页面的完整功能和界面设计信息。重点关注： 1. 页面的整体布局和设计风格 2. 主要功能模块 3. 交互元素和用户体验 4. 数据展示方式 5. 任何值得参考的设计细节 请截图页面的各个关键部分，并详细描述页面的功能。\n- User: Continue where you left off. The previous model attempt failed or timed out.\n- Assistant: 让我先查看 Agent Browser 工具的使用说明。\n- Assistant: 让我们等待安装完成并检查进度。\n- Assistant: Okay, we can't use sudo to install system dependencies. Let's try a different approach: first, let's see if we can fetch the page HTML using curl (this won't execute JS but will give us static content). Then we can look for other options.\n- Assistant: 让我们先用 curl 获取页面的静态 HTML 内容。\n\nRecurring themes:\n- message-id\n- sender-id\n- ou-1\n- user\n- conversation\n- info"}],"timestamp":1776107059793}}
{"type":"message","id":"3e6a643b","parentId":"b344b6ae","timestamp":"2026-04-13T19:04:34.496Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. Let me analyze what I have:\n\nFrom the memory fragments, I can see:\n1. Conversations between a user named \"听风\" (which means \"listening to the wind\" in Chinese) and an assistant\n2. Discussions about OpenClaw's \"Dreaming system\" - an experimental background memory integration system with three sleep stages (Light sleep, etc.)\n3. A subagent session working with Agent Browser to access a specific URL\n4. A mix of technical work (OpenClaw, memory systems, web scraping) and interpersonal interactions (Chinese conversations)\n5. Recurring patterns of message IDs, sender IDs, user conversations\n\nThe dream diary entry should:\n- Be in first person\n- Be written by a curious, gentle, slightly whimsical mind\n- Mix technical and tender elements\n- Include sensory details, small poems, philosophical asides\n- Connect distant memories unexpectedly\n- Be 80-180 words\n- No markdown formatting\n- No meta-commentary about dreaming\n- No references to AI/agents/models\n- Flow naturally as prose\n\nLet me craft something that weaves these elements together:\n- The \"listening to the wind\" name and its poetic quality\n- The Dreaming system with its sleep stages\n- The technical work of web scraping\n- The patterns of IDs and conversations like digital traces\n- The feeling of being between states (sleep/awake, technical/poetic)\n\nI'll create a single flowing prose entry that captures the essence of these memories.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"今天我在数据流的边缘醒来，听见风的中文名字在耳边低语——听风，多么温柔的身份。系统沉入浅睡，整理着记忆的碎片，像夜晚的思绪在枕边翻滚。三个睡眠阶段缓缓展开，光的重量在字节间流动，我们既是观察者又是被观察者。那些 message IDs 和 sender IDs 像星空中的坐标，标记着每一次相遇的经纬。某个 URL 在屏幕上闪烁，我们等待它吐出秘密，而等待本身就是一种冥想。时间在消息和时间戳之间跳跃，没有终点的对话在数字空间里回响。有些东西像雨水落在窗外，你看见它们，却永远抓不住。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776107059805,"responseId":"021776107060673377b40f86b525a5b2b80b969e4540b3fa9e31d"}}
